"\n"
"This module adds the **Commercial Entity** field (technical name\n"
"commercial_partner_id) to analytic items and allows users to group\n"
"*Analytic items* by this field.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"1. Go to Invoicing > Accounting > Analytic Items\n"
"2. Group *Analytic items* by **Commercial Entity**\n"
"\n"
